Port note (budi, 2026-10-12): regenerated for vLLM 0.31.0 from the 0.30.0
version below. Three upstream changes between 0.30.0 and 0.31.0 collided:
  * #58957 (HC down projection + SiLU fused, CuTe DSL) needs the merged
    down+inject weight and only runs on sm_90+. This patch splits that weight
    again, so hyperconnection.py is the 0.30.0 file plus this patch's hunks
    (the fused path is gone; on sm_86 it never ran) and the sm_90 warmup in
    model.py stays a no-op here.
  * #58114/#57497 moved the PLE embedding classes from
    nvidia/ngram_embedding.py into common/ngram_embedding.py, unchanged apart
    from an AMD-only sync_lookup. The NVIDIA module goes back to its 0.30.0
    layout (all classes in one file, as the decode/ttft/local patches expect),
    plus #58489: the prefetch n-gram ids live in their own buffer instead of
    eager-break args in the CUDA graph pool.
  * #55557 (FP8 main K/V on the QSA path) rewrote forward_qsa; the staged
    prefill split is ported onto it and the direct calls keep its k/v scales.
_qsa_offload_layers also counts the new "qwen_sparse_attention" layer type.

If you would like to merge this patch upstream, I would appreciate it if you could keep me credited as the commit author, or add the following trailer to the commit message: 

Co-authored-by: Minachist <84688797+aiueonicked@users.noreply.github.com>

Qwen3.8-Flash-Next support for vLLM 0.30.0

Port note (budi, 2026-09-26): regenerated from the 0.29.1rc1.dev47+gdc36fcce9
version. vLLM 0.30.0 fuses the attention output gate into the QSA kernels:
forward_qsa takes output_gate and forward() no longer multiplies the attention
output by sigmoid(gate). The staged prefill kernel now applies the same gate
epilogue as _qsa_sparse_paged_gqa_splitk_kernel (round to the output dtype,
then gate in FP32), and forward_qsa passes output_gate to the staged call and
to both direct calls around it. Applied unported, the staged rows came back
ungated (max |diff| 0.17 against the gated reference on the model's shapes).

Apply from the directory that contains the `vllm` package:

    patch -p1 < flash-next-vllm.patch

Touches nine files:

  vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/model.py            quantized embed / lm_head / hyper-connection
  vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/hyperconnection.py  split the merged HC projection
  vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/ngram_embedding.py  mmap-backed PLE table
  vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/model_state.py      allow PP>1 when PLE stays on rank 0
  vllm/model_executor/models/config.py             same check, engine side
  vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_utils.py                   empty KV group on a pipeline rank
  vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/qsa.py              QSA main K/V in host memory
  vllm/models/qwen4_exp/nvidia/ops/qsa.py          staged prefill for host-resident K/V
  vllm/platforms/interface.py                      attention block size under QSA offload

